msgstr "Tu sa nastavuje *Poloha* (X, Y) a *Zoom* (Veľkosť)"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/position_and_zoom.rst:74
msgid "Background Color"
msgstr "Farba pozadia"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/position_and_zoom.rst:75
msgid "Picker"
msgstr "Výberník"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/position_and_zoom.rst:76
msgid ""
"Define the background color to be used when zooming out reveals the "
"background. Default is Alpha."
msgstr ""
"Definuje farbu pozadia, ktorá sa použije pri oddialení, keď sa odhalí "
"pozadie. Predvolene je Alfa."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/position_and_zoom.rst:80
msgid ""
"As of this writing and in version 23.04 there are many confirmed reports "
"that the compositing of clips using the **Position and Zoom** effect does "
"not work properly and leaves artifacts. A bug report has been created, and "
"until it is fixed use the :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"transform_distort_perspective/transform` effect instead."
msgstr ""
"K dátumu tohto zápisu a vo verzii 23.04 existuje mnoho potvrdených hlásení, "
"že kompozitovanie klipov pomocou efektu **Poloha a zoom** nefunguje správne "
"a zanecháva artefakty. Bol vytvorený hlásenie o chybe a kým nie je opravené, "
"použite namiesto neho efekt :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"transform_distort_perspective/transform`."

